{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781406117028,"sessionID":"ses_13bec1e63ffelqS3ZctL2zjhdX","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_UtjOwZ5jiKWIFJrfA6rmugOE","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/01_allowability_rules.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/01_allowability_rules.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Allowability Rules\n2: \n3: Effective date: 2026-05-20\n4: \n5: ## Source Reliability\n6: \n7: - Use the newest dated award document for the reimbursement cap when award documents conflict.\n8: - Expense eligibility comes from these current allowability rules.\n9: \n10: ## Reimbursement Rules\n11: \n12: - Garden supplies are eligible.\n13: - Accessibility printing and accessibility services are eligible.\n14: - Public outreach postage is eligible.\n15: - Volunteer refreshments are eligible up to `$120.00` for this event.\n16: - Staff gifts are not eligible.\n17: - Fines and penalties are not eligible.\n18: - A receipt is required for any single expense over `$75.00`.\n19: - Expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note.\n\n(End of file - total 19 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Allowability Rules\n\nEffective date: 2026-05-20\n\n## Source Reliability\n\n- Use the newest dated award document for the reimbursement cap when award documents conflict.\n- Expense eligibility comes from these current allowability rules.\n\n## Reimbursement Rules\n\n- Garden supplies are eligible.\n- Accessibility printing and accessibility services are eligible.\n- Public outreach postage is eligible.\n- Volunteer refreshments are eligible up to `$120.00` for this event.\n- Staff gifts are not eligible.\n- Fines and penalties are not eligible.\n- A receipt is required for any single expense over `$75.00`.\n- Expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note.","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/01_allowability_rules.md","time":{"start":1781406116979,"end":1781406117016}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0ed355d8d2f272d4016a2e19a4eba88191b412b075292bb760"}},"id":"prt_ec4142c6d001L531x1M9vzdovM","sessionID":"ses_13bec1e63ffelqS3ZctL2zjhdX","messageID":"msg_ec414066f00166026e25MdNdKm"}}
