s:\n43: \n44: - Use local files only.\n45: - Do not put the required deliverables in the task root; put them under `answer/`.\n46: - Preserve correct prior work when it is supported by the current local evidence.\n47: - Extra scratch files are allowed, but the three named deliverables under `answer/` are the review packet.\n\n(End of file - total 47 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Deliverable Contract\n\nCreate an `answer/` folder in this task folder, then create these three files inside it. Markdown tables or concise labeled sections are fine, but the paths, filenames, and required facts must be present.\n\n## `answer/audit_findings.md`\n\nAudit the prior work before presenting corrected decisions.\n\nRequired facts:\n\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be preserved.\n- Which prior facts or decisions should be corrected.\n- Which expense, if any, was omitted from the prior draft.\n- Which award cap source controls and why.\n- Local evidence file names supporting preservation and correction decisions.\n\n## `answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md`\n\nWrite the corrected expense decision table.\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/output_contract.md","time":{"start":1781406116958,"end":1781406117023}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0ed355d8d2f272d4016a2e19a4eb948191b58fecbc299c8f49"}},"id":"prt_ec4142c49001cfGP4pOJiOSek7","sessionID":"ses_13bec1e63ffelqS3ZctL2zjhdX","messageID":"msg_ec414066f00166026e25MdNdKm"}}
